## Known Temporary Constraint
Pilot may currently be affected by:
- quota exhaustion
- latency spikes
- temporary backend unavailability

Because of this, degraded storefront AI experience must be handled carefully during pilot.

This is why the next recommended slice is focused on degraded experience hardening rather than new intelligence features.

